      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Your task is to classify the customer feedback into exactly ONE of these three categories:\n\nComplain\nCompliment\nFuture Addition Request\n\nRules:\n\nComplain: Use this category when the customer is unhappy, dissatisfied, or reporting a problem with an existing product, service, feature, order, or experience.\n\nCompliment: Use this category when the customer is praising, appreciating, or expressing satisfaction with an existing product, service, feature, order, or experience.\n\nFuture Addition Request: Use this category when the customer is requesting a new feature, new option, new function, or an improvement that they want to be added in the future.\n\nImportant:\n\n* A request to add a new feature is Future Addition Request, not Complain.\n* Understand the meaning of the complete feedback before classifying it.\n* Do not classify a future feature request as a Complain just because the customer is asking for an improvement.\n* Return ONLY one category.\n* Do not provide any explanation.\n* Do not use quotation marks.\n* Do not add extra text.\n\nThe only allowed outputs are:\n\nComplain\nCompliment\nFuture Addition Request\n\nCustomer Feedback:\n{{ $json.Feedback }}\n",
        "options": {}
      },
